<!--      fetch. This is still a secondary source for JHU's own change  -->
<!--      - the repo itself carries no changelog for it.                -->
<!--    - CSSEGISandData/COVID-19 GitHub repository (JHU CSSE) - fetched -->
<!--      directly: time_series_covid19_confirmed_global.csv header      -->
<!--      confirms the file is still wide today (dates as columns,       -->
