<!--      Admin2 (county), standardised Lat/Long and Combined_Key were  -->
<!--      added to the (already-long) daily reports around that date -  -->
<!--      a real change, but to a file that was long from day one, not  -->
<!--      a wide-to-long conversion. This chapter does not build a      -->
<!--      narrative beat around that daily-reports change, to avoid     -->
<!--      re-conflating two separate JHU products the way the previous  -->
<!--      version did.                                                  -->
<!--  Neither of the two figures below (fig-covid-wide-format,           -->
